e a building or make a  rightly time donation around College  Admissions but the people who get hurt  are the people who can't afford it the  people who get hurt or at the lower end  of the socio-economic spectrum and in  this case the people who are hurt are  the people who legitimately have  learning disabilities when there is an a  privilege that has opened up for certain  people it can be abused and in this case  it's being encouraged to be abused  because there is no more objective  standard in the system all right Michael  lols thank you very much for joining us  and congratulations on that SAT score by  the way  ironically 800 math 800 verbal and then  on the writing section was the section  at that time they had a writing section  he was the one I didn't get a perfect  score and then I went on to write a  blank book so I guess it makes sense  thank you very much Michael
 

